00:18:17,203 --> 00:18:22,609
 We pray to Allah to split the sea, the sea didn't even have to split, we just walked over it.

236
00:18:23,618 --> 00:18:27,191
So you can see that during the time of Abu Bakr As-Siddique رضي الله عنه

