246
00:19:07,104 --> 00:19:09,606
They're the same thing, a supernatural event.

247
00:19:10,165 --> 00:19:14,008
 However, when it happens to a Nabi(نَبِي) it is called Mu'jiza(معجزة).

248
00:19:14,317 --> 00:19:18,735
 And when it happens to a Wali(ولي), or the Awliya(أولياء) of Allah, it is called Karamah(كرامة).

249
00:19:20,967 --> 00:19:24,592
There's a lot said about Karamaat(كرامات) happening to Awliya(أولياء) of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ

250
00:19:24,617 --> 00:19:27,569
